# Black hole: it swallows whatever drifts too close.
#
# The hole draws NOTHING in the world view — its ring is minimap-only
# (black_hole.cpp) — so the clip shows it purely by its effect: rocks given
# slow, mostly-tangential velocities curve visibly before they go. Fast
# radial approaches just blink out and read as rocks despawning.
#
# HUD stays OFF despite the minimap being the only thing that draws the hole:
# in one-player the HUD also carries a "PLAYER 2 PRESS ENTER TO JOIN" banner,
# which is not something to put in a marketing clip. The curve has to carry it.
seed 51
sim 400
frames 120
fps 30
size 960 540
clear
hud off
camera fixed
zoom 60
ship -400 -260 25
blackhole 60 40
asteroid -340 380 r=70 v=62,4
asteroid 470 330 r=60 v=-10,-64
asteroid 450 -290 r=65 v=-8,60
asteroid -320 -280 r=55 v=58,10
asteroid 40 470 r=50 v=66,-6
